  "description": "Climb every peak, enjoy every valley. With our new ALLMTN 6, you’re perfectly equipped for any mountain adventure – uphill, downhill, and even when the terrain gets rough. The foundation of this versatility is our specially developed all-mountain frame platform, paired with the powerful Bosch Performance CX motor, making no trail too steep. The rest of the setup also delivers, featuring a mullet wheel mix, 160mm front travel, 150mm rear travel and sharp Shimano disc brakes. The 800Wh battery ensures you have plenty of endurance for those long climbs, and with the optional Range Extender, you can take your range even further. Ideal conditions to experience the best of both the peaks and valleys – anywhere you ride.",
